    "title": "Relation Insurance acquires Pennsylvania-based LaPlaca Insurance - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nataly Kramer ,\n1 days ago Relation Insurance Services, a US insurance brokerage providing risk management and employee benefits consulting, has acquired the assets of Pennsylvania-based LaPlaca Insurance Inc. Terms of the transaction were not disclosed. The acquisition became effective June 30, 2026, expanding Relation’s presence across the greater Philadelphia area and neighbouring insurance markets. Read full article",
